cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below, and cite Alapan Chaudhuri's thread, where the method comes from."
type: software
title: "training-forensics: Your fine-tune's weights keep a receipt for its training data"
abstract: "When a fine-tuned model is released next to its base model, the two files together record which vocabulary tokens the fine-tuning data contained. An independent replication and extension of a method by Alapan Chaudhuri: 421 comparisons between a release and its base, covering 580 models, plus controlled fine-tunes with full ground truth."
